{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "1074f74561f4936effe1858b85c71ff0",
    "m_Title": "Principe",
    "m_Content": "La courbe = ligne plate + 2 arcs de pied (creux, rayon r) + 1 arc de sommet (bombé, rayon R), raccordés sans cassure.\nOn calcule la vraie distance à chaque morceau, on garde la plus petite, puis on la signe (+ au-dessus, − en dessous).\nRésultat : toutes les bandes ont exactement la même épaisseur.\nPosition objet × échelle : tout est en mètres.",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -10800,
        "y": -4400,
        "width": 650,
        "height": 200
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "6c755aaaf2302b5b5a9ea51c6bc17a06"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "82bf34c2338c83b462898d329ee48fd2",
    "m_Title": "Repère",
    "m_Content": "X = |x − Centre| (la bosse est symétrique)\ns = +1 si Hauteur ≥ 0, −1 sinon (creux : on retourne Y)\nY = (y − Position Y) × s",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -10500,
        "y": -3840,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 120
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "8d9f8d2ce11936b51cb1f09544bb359b"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "044a5b58128607d4e3b50dc2d1f26682",
    "m_Title": "Géométrie",
    "m_Content": "a = Largeur / 2 ; h = |Hauteur| limitée à a (au-delà la bosse surplomberait)\nRs = (a² + h²) / 4h ; r = Arrondi × Rs ; R = (2 − Arrondi) × Rs\nCentre du sommet C1 = (0, h − R) ; centre du pied C2 = (a, r)\nn = (C2 − C1) / (R + r) ; raccord T = C1 + R·n",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -10500,
        "y": -3090,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 160
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "9c059d192d641836f1dfad0f285f0060"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "65297ab6a91880d02b76d3f03a2c2207",
    "m_Title": "Sommet",
    "m_Content": "v = P − C1. Si v est dans l'angle de l'arc (produit vectoriel n × v ≥ 0) : d1 = | |v| − R |, sinon 1000 (ignoré).",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -10500,
        "y": -2380,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 110
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "d774f217a6ac1a82268cbaa19d7acac8"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "5d649adac3c6cc673970e33764614afe",
    "m_Title": "Pieds",
    "m_Content": "w = P − C2. Dans l'angle de l'arc si (−n) × w ≥ 0 et w.x ≤ 0 : d2 = | |w| − r |, sinon 1000.",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -10500,
        "y": -1820,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 110
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "5a0fad7f3f55a02b988a28faf8765380"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "353564f61cb1deaf9fd483daa9b3759b",
    "m_Title": "Ligne et raccords",
    "m_Content": "Si X ≥ a : d3 = |Y|, sinon 1000.\nPlus la distance aux deux points de raccord T et B = (a, 0) (couvre les angles quand Arrondi = 0).",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -10500,
        "y": -1260,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 120
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "1708a8a6718074e272cc81b47f2641a2"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "a318536e2453db56cb1060d9317b6ae2",
    "m_Title": "Signe",
    "m_Content": "Hauteur de la courbe à l'abscisse X (arc du sommet si X ≤ T.x, arc de pied sinon, 0 au-delà de a).\nsigne = +1 si Y ≥ hauteur, −1 sinon.",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -10500,
        "y": -700,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 120
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "d8ca400316009efadf662130e106ad88"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "2c2dbca40662a13301a2fb7fb1beffbe",
    "m_Title": "Distance",
    "m_Content": "d = min(d1, d2, d3, |P−T|, |P−B|) × signe × s",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -10500,
        "y": 10,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 80
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "12357ef44f47362a8b8ae547c29a9425"
    }
}

{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "934d1d3ec6ccac73557aab1855b3a34f",
    "m_Title": "Bandes",
    "m_Content": "k = Floor(d / Épaisseur + 0,5) ; k = 0 = bande de référence.\nZone : −Bandes Dessous ≤ k ≤ Bandes Dessus. Hors zone : ColorBackground.\nCouleur : k + Graine → Random Range → palette du keyword Gradients.",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -3710,
        "y": -1550,
        "width": 600,
        "height": 140
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": ""
    }
}

